**Finding:** The serve-idm.sh relic tool is perturbative only: it has no Sommerfeld or coannihilation switch, no charged-splitting input and no delta_m input (Omega h^2 = 0.1202 at 1160 GeV for delta = 400, 500 and 600 keV). Its 'consistent_planck' flag is unreliable: it reports True at 25 sigma tension (1000 and 1300 GeV) and False at 39 sigma (900 GeV).
